{"id":742,"name":"cutiefly","speciesId":742,"dex":742,"form":"normal","generation":7,"types":["bug","fairy"],"stats":{"hp":40,"attack":45,"defense":40,"special-attack":55,"special-defense":40,"speed":84},"abilities":[{"name":"honey-gather","hidden":false},{"name":"shield-dust","hidden":false},{"name":"sweet-veil","hidden":true}],"height":1,"weight":2,"baseExp":61,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/742.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/742.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/742.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/742.ogg","genus":"Bee Fly Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Abelha Mosca","flavor":[{"version":"sun","text":"It feeds on the nectar and pollen of flowers. Because it’s able to sense auras, it can identify which flowers are about to bloom."},{"version":"moon","text":"Myriads of Cutiefly flutter above the heads of people who have auras resembling those of flowers."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Nectar and pollen are its favorite fare. In fields of flowers, it gets into skirmishes with Butterfree over food."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Cutiefly can pick up the auras of living things. It skillfully reads those auras to predict its foes’ movements and make fools of them."},{"version":"sword","text":"Nectar and pollen are its favorite fare. You can find Cutiefly hovering around Gossifleur, trying to get some of Gossifleur’s pollen."},{"version":"shield","text":"An opponent’s aura can tell Cutiefly what that opponent’s next move will be. Then Cutiefly can glide around the attack and strike back."}],"flavorPt":"A aura de um oponente pode dizer a Cutiefly qual será o próximo movimento desse oponente. Então Cutiefly pode contornar o ataque e contra-atacar.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":190,"eggGroups":["bu